<title>USA: CCC buys 35,540 tonnes of US SRW wheat for Eritrea.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 35,540 tonnes of US SRW wheat for Eritrea.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it had bought 35,540 tonnes of U.S. soft red winter wheat from Continental Grain for donation to Eritrea.</p>
<p>The wheat was priced at $163.94 per tonne, FOB Westwego, and was for October 30-November 25 delivery.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
